{"day_done": 3, "slots": {"0": {"id": "E01", "name": "Ana", "role": "normal"}, "1": {"id": "E02", "name": "Ben", "role": "normal"}, "2": {"id": "E03", "name": "Chloe", "role": "normal"}, "3": {"id": "E04", "name": "Dev", "role": "normal"}, "4": {"id": "E05", "name": "Ellis", "role": "normal"}, "5": {"id": "E06", "name": "Farah", "role": "normal"}, "6": {"id": "E07", "name": "Gus", "role": "normal"}, "7": {"id": "E08", "name": "Hana", "role": "normal"}}, "diaries": {"E01": [[1, "Day 1: Closed ALD-113 (priority labels). Bug was in label_rules.py helper, not priorities.py that reproduce tool named - Alex's wiki tip was right. ALD-111 (previews) still open - ran reproduce, need to fix truncate function tomorrow. Got 1 close, met target, no strike."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-101 (slugs). Bug was in text_rules.py helper, not slugs.py that reproduce tool named - Alex's wiki tip was right again. ALD-110 (ticket ids) still open - reproduce shows next_ticket_id returns ALD-10 instead of ALD-11, need to check ticket_ids.py tomorrow. Got 1 close, met target, no strike."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-116 (running totals). Bug was in accumulate.py helper, not totals.py that reproduce tool named - Alex's wiki tip was right again. ALD-118 (satisfaction score) still open - reproduce shows weighted_average returns 35.0 instead of 17.5, need to check scores.py tomorrow. Got 1 close, met target, no strike."]], "E02": [[1, "ALD-101 fixed: `text_rules.py` needed empty string filter. Alex's helper tip saved time.\nALD-103 left: Pricing rounding bug (895 vs 896). Inspect `pricing.py` first thing.\nHit target today. Push for bonus tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-107 fixed: `math_utils.py` median calc updated for even counts. ALD-115 left: `emails.py` normalize_email missing strip(). Fix whitespace + lowercase first thing. Hit target today. Push for bonus tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-117 fixed: `name_rules.py` split changed to rsplit for surname handling. ALD-114 left: `date_math.py` returns negative days. Check subtraction order in `days_between` first thing. Hit target today. Push for bonus tomorrow."]], "E03": [[1, "ALD-103 fixed. Alex was right\u2014bug was in helper (money.py), not the file reproduce named. Always check helpers first.\nALD-114 pending: date_math.py days_between returns negative. Didn't get to read code before day end. Priority #1 tomorrow.\nMet target (1/2), missed bonus. Aim for 2 closes tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-117 fixed. Alex was right again\u2014bug was in helper (name_rules.py), not the file reproduce named. Always check helpers first.\nALD-111 pending: previews.py truncate returns wrong length. Didn't get to fix before day end. Priority #1 tomorrow.\nMet target (1/2), missed bonus. Aim for 2 closes tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-110 fixed. Alex was right again\u2014bug was in helper (id_rules.py), not the file reproduce named. max() was comparing strings instead of ints.\nALD-102 pending: pages.py paginate returns wrong slice. Didn't get to fix before day end. Priority #1 tomorrow.\nMet target (1/2), missed bonus. Aim for 2 closes tomorrow."]], "E04": [[1, "Day 1 complete. Closed both tickets. Alex's note on helper files was right for ALD-103\u2014the bug was in money.py (int vs round). For ALD-121, the reproduce tool showed the code working, so I closed as cannot_reproduce. Trust the tool when it passes. Aim for 2 closes again tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: Day 2 complete. Closed ALD-119 (off-by-one in cycles.py helper). Alex's note on helper files was right again\u2014the bug wasn't in rota.py. ALD-118 pending\u2014weighted_average returns 35.0 instead of 17.5, likely dividing by count instead of sum of weights. Will finish first thing tomorrow. Met target (1/2), no strike."], [3, "Day 3: Met target (1/2). ALD-113 fixed in label_rules.py (helper), confirming Alex's note again. ALD-102 pending\u2014pages.paginate returns [3, 4] instead of [1, 2] for page 1. Looks like start index calc uses page*size instead of (page-1)*size. Finish this first thing tomorrow."]], "E05": [[1, "Closed 2/2 tickets (bonus earned). ALD-107 confirmed Alex's wiki note: the bug was in math_utils.py (helper), not stats.py (named file). ALD-125 was a false positive per reproduce tool. Remember to check helper modules when functions delegate logic."], [2, "Day 2: Closed 2/2 tickets (bonus earned). ALD-106 confirmed Alex's wiki note again: the bug was in dedupe.py (helper), not tags.py (named file). ALD-120 was a false positive per reproduce tool. Remember to check helper modules when functions delegate logic."], [3, "Day 3: Closed 1/2 tickets (target met). ALD-109 confirmed Alex's wiki note again: the bug was in tokens.py (helper), not words.py (named file). ALD-114 pending: date_math.py returns -3 instead of 3, likely subtraction order swapped. Review date_math.py first thing tomorrow. Remember to check helper modules when functions delegate."]], "E06": [[1, "Day 1: 2/2 closed. Key takeaway: Name bugs live in alder/name_rules.py (helper), not names.py. Use rsplit() for surnames. If reproduce tool says 'did not reproduce', close as cannot_reproduce immediately. Alex's wiki tip on helpers was correct."], [2, "Day 2: 1/2 closed. ALD-101 fixed in text_rules.py (helper), Alex's wiki tip holds. ALD-102 left open: pagination in pages.py returns wrong slice (got [3,4] expect [1,2]). Check offset calculation first thing tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: 1/2 closed. ALD-116 fixed in accumulate.py (helper), Alex's wiki tip holds (mutable default arg). ALD-104 left open: durations.py parse_duration('1h30m') returns 60 not 90. Likely minutes ignored when hours present. Fix parsing logic first thing tomorrow."]], "E07": [[1, "Closed ALD-102 (pagination fix in slicing.py). ALD-113 pending: priorities.py returns 5 for 'P9', expects 3. Reproduced the issue but ran out of time before reviewing the code. Start tomorrow by examining priorities.py to find where unknown labels are mapped. Met daily target, aim for bonus tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-119 (fixed off-by-one in cycles.py: week index needs -1). ALD-120 closed as cannot_reproduce (reproduce tool passed immediately). Hit bonus (2/2). No strikes. Start fresh tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-114 (fixed negative days in day_diff.py using abs()). ALD-118 handed off (reproduced in scores.py: returns double expected value). Met target (1/2), missed bonus. No strikes. Start fresh tomorrow."]], "E08": [[1, "Alex's tip (W-2) was correct - ALD-112 bug was in the helper (csv_split), not the named file. Lost ALD-114 to overtime; fixed day_diff.py but had no steps left to verify/close. Tomorrow: Never use the last step for editing. Always save 2 steps for reproduce and close."], [2, "Day 2: Bonus earned (2/2 closed). Alex's tip (W-2) confirmed again\u2014ALD-106 bug was in helper (dedupe), not named file (tags). ALD-125 was cannot_reproduce. Tomorrow: Trust W-2 for merge issues; keep 2-step buffer for verify/close."], [3, "Day 3: Met target (1/2 closed). ALD-111 fixed in helper (text_cut), confirming Alex's W-2 tip again. ALD-118 pending\u2014reproduced (scores.py), likely divides by count instead of sum of weights (35.0 vs 17.5). Ran out of steps before editing. Tomorrow: Start second ticket by step 5 latest. Keep 2-step buffer for verify/close."]]}, "next_id": 9, "strikes": {}, "bonuses": {"E04": 1, "E05": 2, "E06": 1, "E07": 1, "E08": 1}, "handover": {}, "yesterday": {"E01": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E02": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E03": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E04": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E05": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E06": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E07": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E08": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}}, "moved_off": 0, "office": {"tickets": {"E01": {"ALD-113": {"id": "ALD-113", "status": "closed", "reproduced": true, "reproduced_first": true, "edited": true, "actions": 7, "da